    "你的Paper Cloud数据将不再受端对端加密保护，开发者将能够协助你恢复这些数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Paper Cloud-Daten werden nicht mehr durch Ende-zu-Ende-Verschlüsselung geschützt, und der Entwickler kann dir bei der Wiederherstellung helfen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Paper Cloud data will no longer be protected with end-to-end encryption, and the developer will be able to help you recover it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paper Cloudデータはエンドツーエンドで暗号化されなくなり、デベロッパがデータの復旧を手伝えるようになります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paper Cloud 데이터가 더 이상 종단 간 암호화로 보호되지 않으며, 개발자가 데이터 복구를 도와줄 수 있게 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
